                "text": "Thank you for your letter, Christine!\n\nWe must treat mental health like the critical component of wellness that it is. I was proud to fight to ensure Medicare can cover mental health services in NH and beyond.\n\nLearn more\u27a1\ufe0fhttps://t.co/639SE5QQ4V\nhttps://t.co/6Jpxf9AAS5",
